647204434_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qwVRBwhBOJ0Q7kNvwGMTyiS&_nc_oc=Adqz6J6VSZXtcqAaV6eFHEwuDWgFGE_99BHdbvEZFBAWngzOZ1GypW1Su8wBpAQbYaA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-rzmZtGWA4FDDucCFb4RzSmRCWdQ7ruC3_op4T1p1PKA&oe=6A3811CD"}, {"file_name": "test7.png", "id": "565618102256686", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75361358_565618105590019_5920312683290974218_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VWgpyY5XZf8Q7kNvwGm3rWJ&_nc_oc=AdptfS07CS859Xx7gmE1GZ1y01ck1s6-TKsoQ1VO5Y6ZSdLFtJh9nWy2Su5kIqBFIJc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af84VFvvO3XleoeuCrRc4MqDNAEXskTZbtS25xqm9PCCbQ&oe=6A37EBD8"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Landscape.png", "id": "848586576168849", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75282159_848586579502182_7887603643736152128_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=bISdtniCJaQQ7kNvwG4u6Ji&_nc_oc=AdoZCZWYyk-lfYVf2keDzn8BFvlWx3Az7GletVv8KDA6r0mzYoHwRSVNlGvr2_KJDis&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-Ab0SXJW3Imdk17aXQd-bcFJvxR1gtWqOE78SbyTVFlA&oe=6A37F837"}, "display_name": "Ghosts Of Tabor", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ghosts of Tabor is the only extraction based VR FPS PVP and PVE survival game where you will have to use your wits, skills and resources to survive. Inspired by games such as Escape from Tarkov and Day Z, the game features a variety of scenarios from scavenging, looting to crafting. Make your safehouse your own by building your personal collection weapons and gear to display in your armory.\n\nGhosts of Tabor is packed with features for unlimited replayability including:\n\n\u25cf Simultaneous PVP and PVE - Avoid both players and armed AI\n\u25cf Scavenge for a wide variety of loot such as gear, weapons, attachments, ammo,\nmedical, food and water\n\u25cf Squad up or go at it alone in the world's most dangerous looting grounds\n\u25cf Make your way to your extraction point to get out with your life and your gear.\n\u25cf Customize weapons and craft items\n\u25cf Craft ammo of different types and sizes\n\u25cf Variety of weapons ranging from handguns to assault rifles\n\u25cf Huge armory to display your arsenal of weapons, armor, and gear\n\u25cf Choose your load out carefully\n\u25cf Visit the marketplace to source anything you may need for your next raid\n\u25cf Complete missions with vendors to unlock special goods\n\nChoose your playstyle from guns-a- blazing or take a stealthy approach. It\u2019s up to you to find a way to escape Tabor alive. \n\nCan you survive the Ghosts of Tabor?", "short_description": "Ghosts of Tabor is the only extraction based VR FPS PVP and PVE survival game where you will have to use your wits, skills and resources to survive. Inspired by games such as Escape from Tarkov and DayZ, the game features a variety of scenarios from scavenging to looting and crafting. You never know who's around the next corner. Will you survive long enough to make it out alive?"}]}, "developer_name": "Combat Waffle Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://ghostsoftabor.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://ghostsoftabor.com/terms-and-conditions/", "publisher_name": "Beyond Frames Entertainment", "support_website_url": "https://ghostsoftabor.com/", "website_url": "https://ghostsoftabor.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SHOOTER", "ACTION", "ADVENTURE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_inpu